---
title: Maths Week Scotland - Dundee University
---

Welcome! This site was created in 2026 at the University of Dundee for our
[Maths Trail at the Dundee Botanic Gardens](https://www.dundee.ac.uk/events/maths-trail-dundee-botanic-garden),
as part of the wider [Maths Week Scotland](https://mathsweek.scot) programme of events.
It is designed to be used while exploring the [Botanic Gardens](https://www.dundee.ac.uk/botanic)
and using a smart-phone to scan QR barcodes taking you to individual pages here.
